    "final": "Found 2 verified senior backend, remote-US positions:\n\n**1. Senior Backend Engineer — Fieldwire**\n- Location: United States (Remote) — verified on employer posting\n- Link: https://www.fieldwire.com/job/8633653002/?gh_jid=8633653002\n- Score: **55.02** — partial fit\n- Why: Senior title + US-remote verified. Degree and AWS familiarity matched, plus production services/scale work aligns with Senior experience on AWS/EKS and PostgreSQL.\n- Caveats: Missing Ruby on Rails required experience; resume is Go/Python. Docker/containerization only partial. Confirm 5+ years and eligibility on application page.\n\n**2. Senior Backend Engineer (Go/Python) — BearPlex**\n- Location: Remote Global including United States — verified on employer posting\n- Link: https://www.bearplex.com/careers/senior-backend-engineer-go-python\n- Score: **42.7** — limited fit\n- Why: Senior title with Remote including US verified. Best overlap: Go/Python REST APIs, PostgreSQL in production, and AWS EKS/Kubernetes/Terraform matches cloud/container requirement.\n- Caveats: Missing production AI/ML, Rust, event-driven/streaming, retries/backpressure/idempotency; only partial on distributed Go/Python and Docker/K8s/AWS. Confirm US eligibility.\n\nSources:\n- LinkedIn jobs search was login-blocked, switched to public employer career pages per instructions.\n- Both roles verified directly on employer postings, read and scored. No applications made, no schedule created.\n\nBoth meet senior + remote-US on their postings, but neither is a strong resume match — Fieldwire needs Rails, BearPlex needs AI-heavy distributed systems depth.",
